OL,3,GNEWSACouncil relationships 'badly
OL,4,Aeroded', says review
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt recommended setting up a shadow
OL,7,Fcabinet and introducing a cross-party
OL,8,Fbudget development process, adding that
OL,9,Fanyone unable to make the necessary
OL,10,Fchanges should "consider their
OL,11,Fcontinuing role".
OL,13,FA joint statement from all party
OL,14,Fleaders said they were committed to
OL,15,F"supporting the implementation of all
OL,16,Fof the actions".
